Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.90,JP,,0,0,0,,ペッパ、次に買うものは何？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.90,VI,,0,0,0,,Peppa, món tiếp theo cần mua là gì?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:04.20,JP,,0,0,0,,ポテトチップス！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.38,0:00:04.20,VI,,0,0,0,,Khoai tây chiên!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:06.48,JP,,0,0,0,,ポテトチップスは書いてないよ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.20,0:00:06.48,VI,,0,0,0,,Khoai tây chiên đâu có ghi trong danh sách.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:08.90,JP,,0,0,0,,ポテトチップスはお家にあるでしょ？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.48,0:00:08.90,VI,,0,0,0,,Khoai tây chiên ở nhà có rồi mà.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:10.66,JP,,0,0,0,,もう一度当ててごらん。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.90,0:00:10.66,VI,,0,0,0,,Con đoán lại lần nữa xem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.66,0:00:12.50,JP,,0,0,0,,うーん、だめだ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.66,0:00:12.50,VI,,0,0,0,,Ưm, chịu thôi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:13.82,JP,,0,0,0,,思い出せない。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.50,0:00:13.82,VI,,0,0,0,,Con không nhớ ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.82,0:00:15.46,JP,,0,0,0,,ジョージは覚えてる？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.82,0:00:15.46,VI,,0,0,0,,George có nhớ không?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:16.96,JP,,0,0,0,,ダイナソー！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.96,0:00:16.96,VI,,0,0,0,,Khủng long!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:18.94,JP,,0,0,0,,ダイナソー？ジョージ？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.96,0:00:18.94,VI,,0,0,0,,Khủng long á? George?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:23.12,JP,,0,0,0,,ダイナソーはスーパーには売ってないのよ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.82,0:00:23.12,VI,,0,0,0,,Siêu thị đâu có bán khủng long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:26.34,JP,,0,0,0,,違うよ、ジョージ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.22,0:00:26.34,VI,,0,0,0,,Không phải đâu, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:29.24,JP,,0,0,0,,次に買うものは玉ねぎだ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.34,0:00:29.24,VI,,0,0,0,,Thứ tiếp theo cần mua là hành tây.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.85,0:00:32.85,JP,,0,0,0,,玉ねぎ。そうだった。思い出した。ここにあるよ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.85,0:00:32.85,VI,,0,0,0,,Hành tây. À đúng rồi. Con nhớ ra rồi. Ở đây này.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.99,0:00:37.29,JP,,0,0,0,,よくできました。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.99,0:00:37.29,VI,,0,0,0,,Giỏi lắm.
